LeftDown 1
Delay 64 ms
MoveTo 1056 985
Delay 64 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 32 ms
KeyUp 225 1
Delay 32 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>minecraft</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>